<title>USA: Utah Housing Agency $25 mln restructured.</title>
<headline>Utah Housing Agency $25 mln restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday it restructured Utah Housing Finance Agency's $25 million bond deal, adding a 2022 maturity.</p>
<p>The restructure follows:</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					     2,250,000*</p>
<p>					  1997 SERIES C-2</p>
<p>					   CLASS II BONDS</p>
<p>			     SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aa2		   S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>	   (EXP)			(EXP)</p>
<p>DATED: 05/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2015		2,250M    6.00  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>					     1,000,000*</p>
<p>					  1997 SERIES C-2</p>
<p>					  CLASS III BONDS</p>
<p>			   SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: A1		    S&amp;P: A+</p>
<p>	   (EXP)			(EXP)</p>
<p>DATED: 05/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>07/01/2009		1,000M    5.85  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 01/01/2007    101.50</p>
<p>		   DTP 01/01/2009</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, May 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on June 17, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>First Security Bank, NA</p>
<p>Zions First National Bank Capital Markets</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
